# 🔴 Migration ki SQL hamesha LF par.
#
# Prisma har migration ka SHA-256 `_prisma_migrations` mein rakhta hai aur har deploy
# par milata hai. Ye machine `core.autocrlf=true` par hai — yani ek taaza clone par
# yehi file CRLF ban jati, us ke bytes badal jate, checksum na milta, aur `migrate
# deploy` ye keh kar ruk jata ke "migration badal di gayi hai" — jabke ek harf bhi na
# badla hota.
#
# Ye us waqt pakri jati jab koi naye computer par pehli dafa deploy kar raha hota —
# yani sab se buray waqt.
*.sql text eol=lf
